1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,080
You say the word sneakers out loud,

2
00:00:02,080 --> 00:00:03,680
and ten minutes later your whole feed

3
00:00:03,680 --> 00:00:04,880
is sneakers.

4
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:05,120
So,

5
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,960
is Instagram listening to you?

6
00:00:06,960 --> 00:00:08,400
Instagram says no.

7
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,120
Its boss,

8
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:10,400
Adam Mosseri,

9
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:13,600
said in 2025 that secretly recording

10
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:15,520
everyone would drain your battery and

11
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:17,520
light up your microphone indicator.

12
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:18,320
And honestly,

13
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,520
it doesn't need to.

14
00:00:19,520 --> 00:00:20,240
Every like,

15
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:20,720
save,

16
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:22,720
share and comment tells Instagram what

17
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:23,360
you're into.

18
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:25,440
Instagram says there isn't one single

19
00:00:25,440 --> 00:00:26,480
algorithm,

20
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:28,480
just lots of small systems,

21
00:00:28,480 --> 00:00:30,160
each one guessing what you'll like.

22
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:32,000
One of them even predicts whether you'll

23
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:33,600
stop and stare at a post for

24
00:00:33,600 --> 00:00:34,560
a few seconds.

25
00:00:34,560 --> 00:00:35,694
Then there's the crowd.

26
00:00:35,694 --> 00:00:37,614
If lots of people are loving something

27
00:00:37,614 --> 00:00:38,414
right now,

28
00:00:38,414 --> 00:00:40,574
Instagram can test it on you too,

29
00:00:40,574 --> 00:00:42,094
especially in Explore.

30
00:00:42,094 --> 00:00:44,334
Advertisers can also share which of their

31
00:00:44,334 --> 00:00:45,774
websites you visited,

32
00:00:45,774 --> 00:00:47,774
so that shoe shop you browsed last

33
00:00:47,774 --> 00:00:49,214
week follows you home.

34
00:00:49,214 --> 00:00:50,574
And your memory helps:

35
00:00:50,574 --> 00:00:52,574
you scroll past a hundred ads,

36
00:00:52,574 --> 00:00:54,334
then only remember the one that matched

37
00:00:54,334 --> 00:00:55,054
your chat.

38
00:00:55,054 --> 00:00:55,614
So no,

39
00:00:55,614 --> 00:00:56,974
it's not a mind reader.

40
00:00:56,974 --> 00:00:58,894
It's a very patient note-taker.

41
00:00:58,894 --> 00:01:00,574
Which makes you wonder what your thumb

42
00:01:00,574 --> 00:01:02,390
has been saying all day.

43
00:01:04,333 --> 00:01:04,733
Like,

44
00:01:04,733 --> 00:01:05,133
share,

45
00:01:05,133 --> 00:01:08,023
and subscribe for more bad ideas.
